1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Johan Vilhelm Grevenkop-Castenskiold''' til Esromgaard, Kammerherre, Ridder af Dannebrog, was born on 23 Nov 1844 in Hørbygaard Gods, Tuse-Næs, Holbæk. He died on 22 Feb 1933 in Fredensborg. Schooled at Sorø Aka
2 CONC demis Skole, 23. august 1854 to 1863. Johan was employed as Kammerherre, Ritmester ( Hæren - Forsvaret ), Godsejer af Esromgaard. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Wife 1'': [http://www.geni.com/people/Henriette-Margarethe-Reinholdine-Elisabeth-Krag/6000000011460257806 Henriette Margarethe Reinholdine Elisabeth Krag], married on 21 Sep 1867 in Ringsted. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT
2 CONT # Carl Vilhelm Grevenkop-Castenskiold was born on 2 Aug 1868 in Sophienborg Gods. He died on 14 Nov 1955. 
2 CONT # Jørgen Vilhelm "Ville" Grevenkop-Castenskiold was born on 14 May 1869 in Sophienborg Gods, Tjæreby. He died on 13 Jun 1886 in Esromgaard. 
2 CONT # Emmy Grevenkop-Castenskiold was born on 27 May 1871 in Sophienborg Gods, Tjæreby. She died on 9 Aug 1875 in Orkerød, Jeløen, Moss, Norge. 
2 CONT # Henriette Margrethe Grevenkop-Castenskiold was born on 13 Nov 1878 in Esromgaard. She died on 24 Jan 1969 in Vallø Slot, Vallø. Henriette was employed as Stiftsdame i Vallø adelige Stift. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Wife 2'': Louise Siegfriede comtesse Knuth af Knuthenborg af Christiandal, married on 28 Oct 1901 in Vester Egesborg Kirke, Vester Egesborg.
2 CONT
