3 STAE Oppland
3 CTRY Norge
1 DEAT
2 DATE 11 AUG 1823
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bergen
3 STAE Hordaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BURI
2 DATE 15 AUG 1823
