1 NAME Gabriel Kirsebom /Kielland/
2 GIVN Gabriel Kirsebom
2 SURN Kielland
2 _MARNM Kielland
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 26 JAN 1796
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norge
