1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Wolf Nagler was born in Uziatin in 1911 and left with his parents on 1916 to Viena. He studied there law and became Dr. in law. His bar mizwa was directed by the Rabbi Zvi Perez Haith. Wolf left Viena in 1938 to Zu
2 CONC rich and stayed there for one year. In 1939 he bought three visas to Bolivia and so he and his parents emigratet to that land. In Bolivia, La Paz, he was one of the directors of Maccabi, the jews organization and so on. On the fir
2 CONC st of april 1951 he married Rosel and in 24.2.1956 he became father. In 1961 he emigreted to Chile , where he lived till 1971. In 1971 he made alia an arrived at Haifa on the 8 of october 1971.   
