1 NAME Kristofer Diedrich /Lehmkuhl/
2 GIVN Kristofer Diedrich
2 SURN Lehmkuhl
2 _MARNM Lehmkuhl
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 25 SEP 1855
