2 CONC r of gas works. Residence: Stengade 2, Moss.
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://digitalarkivet.arkivverket.no/en-gb/ft/person/pf01036336010088 1910 census for Moss]: '''Carl Ludvig Stabell''', b. 09.11.1840 at the farm Elsaas Fanestranden. Ugift. Unmarried. Occupation: Borough engineer. Residence: Ste
2 CONC ngate 2, Moss.
2 CONT
2 CONT Buried 8 September 1917: [http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:kb_read?idx_kildeid=8020&idx_id=8020&uid=ny&idx_side=-383 Moss town parish, Ministerial book no. Fb 0005 (1913-1923), Deaths and burials 1917, page 429]: 32. &dagger; 2/9. Fo
2 CONC rmer borough engineer '''Carl Ludvig Stabell''' unmarried, b. 1840 in Bolsø. Residence: Scharremyren (''Skarmyra, an area in Moss''). Cause of death: Leg amputation and old age. Notes: Dead at Moss hospital.
