1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sigrid Magnus (born Pettersen) was educated as a nurse. She was a very practical and sympathetic person which supported her husband loyally to the end.  She was very tolerant to other peoples choices. She loved her
2 CONC  grandchildren and loved to have them visit her.  She skied until she well into her 80s in order to keep in shape. She was always quite skinny and was always trying to gain weight by eating lots of white bread with plenty of butte
2 CONC r on. She probably suffered from some kind of food intolerance as she died from intestinal cancer in 1985.
