3 CITY Cappelens gate 9
3 STAE Buskerud
3 CTRY Norge
1 DEAT
2 DATE 25 AUG 1894
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Munkedamsveien
3 CITY Kristiania
3 CTRY Norway
