1 NOTE {geni:about_me} NOTE: This profile is possibly  a merge of two different daughters of Castenskiold: Anne Marie (born ca 1730?) and Catharine Marie (born 1735?). The problem needs further verifikations to be solved . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Register til skiftesprotokoll, Nyborg Amt 1703-1811: Andreas von Bergen, Justitsraad og Landsdommer Hans Enke (sonen Daniels enke) Anne Maria Castenschiold paa Vejstrupgaard, VI-180
2 CONT
2 CONT På en websidan anges Daniel von Bergens hustru som Catharine Marie Castenschiold,   b. 1735, Saint Thomas Danish West Indies,   d. 9 Dec 1778, men det bör vara fel http://skeel.info/getperson.php?personID=I21153&tree=ks i samtida 
2 CONC källor är Daniel von Bergen gift med Anne Marie Castenskjöld, men det finns troligtvis också en Anne Catharine?'
2 CONT
